Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:30:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/24] [general] system: crash bundle on FATAL / unhandled
 exception

Writes <crash_bundle_dir>/<timestamp>/ with summary.txt (failure, guest
thread, LR, back-chain walk resolved to sub_ names, host stack),
breadcrumbs.txt (last 300 log lines), args.txt, build_info.txt,
crash.dmp, a copy of the save folder and the last guest frame (BMP).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/rex/system/crash_bundle.h |  18 +++
 src/system/CMakeLists.txt         |   1 +
 src/system/crash_bundle.cpp       | 256 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 275 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 include/rex/system/crash_bundle.h
 create mode 100644 src/system/crash_bundle.cpp

